  "prefLabel": "Env-Dw 710.02 Applicability",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Dw 710.02 Applicability.\n\n(a) The requirements of this part other than Env-Dw 710.05(c) shall apply to community water systems (CWS).\n\n(b) The requirements specified in Env-Dw 710.05(c) shall apply to non-transient non-community water systems.\n\nSource. #9700, eff 5-1-10; ss by #12668, eff 1-1-19",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-dw700.html"
